scratch                *  no-cuda  CPU-only tests; no CUDA call
signed_gpu             *  no-cuda  CPU fits and mock backends only; the device signed fit runs in gpu_fit (signed_arm_projects_the_device_proposal_exactly)
simplify_sound         *  no-cuda  CPU-only tests; no CUDA call
