no_banned_words        *  no-cuda-app-only  no CUDA call in the test process or its children (git, grep, bash: no /dev/nvidia open under strace -f); memcheck with --target-processes all crashes in the sanitizer (SIGSEGV)
panel_spread           *  no-cuda-app-only  no CUDA call in the test process or its rcsr children (no /dev/nvidia open under strace -f); memcheck with --target-processes all crashes in the sanitizer (SIGSEGV)
verksted_tools         *  no-cuda-app-only  no CUDA call in the test process or its children (bash scripts, git, grep: no /dev/nvidia open under strace -f); memcheck with --target-processes all crashes in the sanitizer (SIGSEGV)
cpu_makes_no_device_call *  no-cuda-app-only  strace counts /dev/nvidia opens of rcsr --cpu commands, which are 0 by design; a ptrace tool under the sanitizer tree launcher is not traced
final_seal             *  no-cuda-app-only  every rcsr child runs with RCSR_GPU=0, so no CUDA call in the test process or its children (no /dev/nvidia open under strace -f); memcheck with --target-processes all crashed in the sanitizer (rc 139)
